            <h2>The Problem: Fragmented Investments in India</h2>
            <p>For the modern Indian investor, wealth is scattered. You might have SIPs running on Groww, long-term
                stocks on Zerodha, recent trades on Angel One, Aditya Birla Money, or Upstox, and older mutual funds
                sitting in physical folios.</p>
            <p><strong>The result?</strong> You never actually know your true Net Worth or real <a
                    href="/xirr-calculator/">XIRR</a> (Extended Internal Rate of Return). Tracking across 4 different
                platforms makes it impossible to see your true asset allocation or rebalance effectively.</p>

            <h2>Top stock portfolio trackers on the Market</h2>
            <p>Top stock portfolio trackers, such as Empower, Snowball Analytics, and Sharesight, allow investors to
                consolidate stocks, mutual funds, and other assets into one dashboard, offering real-time performance
                tracking, dividend monitoring, and analytical reports. These platforms provide automated tracking to
                monitor gains, losses, and asset allocation across multiple accounts.</p>

