                <li><strong>Best for Dividend Investors:</strong> Snowball Analytics focuses on dividend income
                    tracking, projections, and graphical analysis.</li>
                <li><strong>Best for International Investors:</strong> Sharesight is known for tracking performance
                    across different currencies and markets.</li>
                <li><strong>Best for Automated Tracking (India):</strong> Arthavi tracks seamlessly with CAS. INDmoney
                    (automates tracking by connecting brokers) and MProfit (supports multi-asset tracking) are also
                    used.</li>
                <li><strong>Best for Privacy:</strong> <strong>Arthavi</strong> is local and secure, acting as an
                    alternative to self-hosted tools like Sharetracker (offline friendly) or customized Google Sheets.
                </li>
            </ul>

