                <li><strong>Performance Metrics:</strong> Tracks total portfolio value, absolute gain, XIRR, and daily
                    profit/loss.</li>
                <li><strong>Dividend Tracking:</strong> Monitors monthly/annual dividend income and growth.</li>
                <li><strong>Asset Allocation:</strong> Visualizes diversification across sectors, countries, and asset
                    classes.</li>
                <li><strong>Tax Reporting:</strong> Offers capital gains reports and tax lot tracking.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Free vs. Paid Options</h3>
