            <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="faq-grid" style="margin: 2rem 0;">
                <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-head); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What is a portfolio
                        tracker?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm">A portfolio tracker is a tool that allows you to monitor all your financial
                        investments—such as stocks, mutual funds, EPF, and bonds—in one place. It helps you track your
                        overall net worth and calculate true returns (XIRR).</p>
                </div>
