                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-head); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What tools help track
                        my family's entire financial portfolio across all investments?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm">You need a tool that supports multi-portfolio tracking or multiple CAS uploads
                        for different PANs. Arthavi makes it easy to track family accounts securely.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-head); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">What sip tools help
                        track portfolio performance across multiple funds?</h3>
